$language_lookup_array["pl"]["Logging in sets one cookie containing your account's authentication token (not your email or password) -- either for your browser session only, or for one year if you choose \"remember me\" at login. It's marked HttpOnly (inaccessible to page scripts) and Secure when the site is served over HTTPS. A second, non-identifying cookie remembers your interface language preference. Neither is used for advertising or tracking, and %1 runs no analytics or tracking scripts of any kind."] = "Logowanie ustawia jeden plik cookie zawierający token uwierzytelniający Twojego konta (nie Twój e-mail ani hasło) -- albo tylko na czas sesji przeglądarki, albo na rok, jeśli podczas logowania wybierzesz opcję \"zapamiętaj mnie\". Jest oznaczony jako HttpOnly (niedostępny dla skryptów strony) i Secure, gdy witryna jest serwowana przez HTTPS. Drugi, nieidentyfikujący plik cookie zapamiętuje Twoje preferencje językowe interfejsu. Żaden z nich nie jest używany do reklam ani śledzenia, a %1 nie uruchamia żadnych skryptów analitycznych ani śledzących.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_BR"]["Logging in sets one cookie containing your account's authentication token (not your email or password) -- either for your browser session only, or for one year if you choose \"remember me\" at login. It's marked HttpOnly (inaccessible to page scripts) and Secure when the site is served over HTTPS. A second, non-identifying cookie remembers your interface language preference. Neither is used for advertising or tracking, and %1 runs no analytics or tracking scripts of any kind."] = "Fazer login define um cookie contendo o token de autenticação da sua conta (não seu e-mail ou senha) -- apenas para a sua sessão do navegador, ou por um ano se você escolher \"lembrar-me\" no login. Ele é marcado como HttpOnly (inacessível a scripts da página) e Secure quando o site é servido via HTTPS. Um segundo cookie, não identificável, lembra sua preferência de idioma da interface. Nenhum dos dois é usado para publicidade ou rastreamento, e o %1 não executa nenhum script de análise ou rastreamento.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_PT"]["Logging in sets one cookie containing your account's authentication token (not your email or password) -- either for your browser session only, or for one year if you choose \"remember me\" at login. It's marked HttpOnly (inaccessible to page scripts) and Secure when the site is served over HTTPS. A second, non-identifying cookie remembers your interface language preference. Neither is used for advertising or tracking, and %1 runs no analytics or tracking scripts of any kind."] = "Iniciar sessão define um cookie contendo o token de autenticação da sua conta (não o seu e-mail ou palavra-passe) -- apenas para a sua sessão do navegador, ou durante um ano se escolher \"lembrar-me\" no início de sessão. Está marcado como HttpOnly (inacessível a scripts da página) e Secure quando o site é servido via HTTPS. Um segundo cookie, não identificável, memoriza a sua preferência de idioma da interface. Nenhum dos dois é usado para publicidade ou monitorização, e o %1 não executa quaisquer scripts de análise ou monitorização.";
$language_lookup_array["ru"]["Logging in sets one cookie containing your account's authentication token (not your email or password) -- either for your browser session only, or for one year if you choose \"remember me\" at login. It's marked HttpOnly (inaccessible to page scripts) and Secure when the site is served over HTTPS. A second, non-identifying cookie remembers your interface language preference. Neither is used for advertising or tracking, and %1 runs no analytics or tracking scripts of any kind."] = "При входе устанавливается один cookie-файл, содержащий токен аутентификации вашей учётной записи (не ваш email или пароль) -- либо только на время сеанса браузера, либо на год, если при входе вы выберете \"запомнить меня\". Он помечен как HttpOnly (недоступен скриптам страницы) и Secure, когда сайт обслуживается по HTTPS. Второй, неидентифицирующий cookie-файл запоминает ваши языковые настройки интерфейса. Ни один из них не используется для рекламы или отслеживания, и %1 не запускает никаких аналитических или отслеживающих скриптов.";
$language_lookup_array["sk"]["Logging in sets one cookie containing your account's authentication token (not your email or password) -- either for your browser session only, or for one year if you choose \"remember me\" at login. It's marked HttpOnly (inaccessible to page scripts) and Secure when the site is served over HTTPS. A second, non-identifying cookie remembers your interface language preference. Neither is used for advertising or tracking, and %1 runs no analytics or tracking scripts of any kind."] = "Prihlásenie nastaví jeden súbor cookie obsahujúci overovací token vášho účtu (nie váš e-mail alebo heslo) -- buď len na dobu relácie prehliadača, alebo na jeden rok, ak si pri prihlásení zvolíte \"zapamätať si ma\". Je označený ako HttpOnly (neprístupný skriptom stránky) a Secure, ak je stránka poskytovaná cez HTTPS. Druhý, needentifikujúci súbor cookie si pamätá vašu preferenciu jazyka rozhrania. Žiadny z nich sa nepoužíva na reklamu ani sledovanie a %1 nespúšťa žiadne analytické ani sledovacie skripty.";
$language_lookup_array["sv"]["Logging in sets one cookie containing your account's authentication token (not your email or password) -- either for your browser session only, or for one year if you choose \"remember me\" at login. It's marked HttpOnly (inaccessible to page scripts) and Secure when the site is served over HTTPS. A second, non-identifying cookie remembers your interface language preference. Neither is used for advertising or tracking, and %1 runs no analytics or tracking scripts of any kind."] = "Att logga in anger en cookie som innehåller ditt kontos autentiseringstoken (inte din e-post eller ditt lösenord) -- antingen bara för din webbläsarsession, eller i ett år om du väljer \"kom ihåg mig\" vid inloggning. Den är märkt HttpOnly (otillgänglig för sidskript) och Secure när webbplatsen levereras via HTTPS. En andra, icke-identifierande cookie kommer ihåg din språkpreferens för gränssnittet. Ingen av dem används för reklam eller spårning, och %1 kör inga analys- eller spårningsskript av något slag.";
$language_lookup_array["tr"]["Logging in sets one cookie containing your account's authentication token (not your email or password) -- either for your browser session only, or for one year if you choose \"remember me\" at login. It's marked HttpOnly (inaccessible to page scripts) and Secure when the site is served over HTTPS. A second, non-identifying cookie remembers your interface language preference. Neither is used for advertising or tracking, and %1 runs no analytics or tracking scripts of any kind."] = "Oturum açmak, hesabınızın kimlik doğrulama belirtecini içeren bir çerez ayarlar (e-postanız veya şifreniz değil) -- yalnızca tarayıcı oturumunuz için ya da girişte \"beni hatırla\"yı seçerseniz bir yıl boyunca. Sayfa betiklerinin erişemeyeceği HttpOnly olarak ve site HTTPS üzerinden sunulduğunda Secure olarak işaretlenir. İkinci, kimliği belirlemeyen bir çerez arayüz dili tercihinizi hatırlar. Hiçbiri reklam veya izleme için kullanılmaz ve %1 hiçbir analitik veya izleme betiği çalıştırmaz.";
