$language_lookup_array["it_IT"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Una volta al giorno, %1 pubblica un'istantanea delle statistiche di account, computer e squadra (nome utente, paese, credito, appartenenza a squadra, e per i computer, dettagli hardware e prestazioni) come file scaricabili su %2, per l'uso da parte di siti di statistiche BOINC. Questo è il comportamento standard del software BOINC stesso: i file sono liberamente raggiungibili da chiunque o qualunque cosa li richieda, indipendentemente dal fatto che un particolare sito di statistiche lo stia effettivamente facendo in questo momento. Il tuo indirizzo email, password e dettagli di autenticazione non sono mai inclusi. Il tuo account e i tuoi computer compaiono in questa esportazione solo se hai già ottenuto del credito di calcolo e hai attivato \"Consenti all'esportazione dei tuoi dati verso i siti di aggregazione statistica di BOINC?\" nelle tue preferenze account -- il consenso è disattivato di default, e puoi disattivarlo di nuovo in qualsiasi momento. Se hai anche attivato \"Camicia può mostrare i tuoi computer sul suo sito web?\", i tuoi computer esportati includeranno anche un collegamento al tuo account. I dati delle squadre non sono coperti da questo consenso: qualsiasi squadra con credito viene esportata indipendentemente dalle preferenze dei suoi membri, incluso l'ID account del fondatore.";
$language_lookup_array["az"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Gündə bir dəfə %1 hesab, kompüter və komanda statistikasının anlıq görüntüsünü (istifadəçi adı, ölkə, kredit, komanda üzvlüyü, kompüterlər üçün isə avadanlıq və performans təfərrüatları) BOINC statistika izləmə saytları üçün istifadə oluna bilən yüklənə bilən fayllar kimi %2 ünvanında dərc edir. Bu, BOINC proqramının özünün standart davranışıdır: fayllar onları tələb edən istənilən kəs və ya şey tərəfindən açıq şəkildə əlçatandır, hazırda müəyyən bir statistika saytının bunu edib-etmədiyindən asılı olmayaraq. E-poçt ünvanınız, parolunuz və autentifikasiya təfərrüatlarınız heç vaxt daxil edilmir. Hesabınız və kompüterləriniz yalnız hesablama krediti qazandıqdan və hesab tərcihlərinizdə \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" seçimini aktivləşdirdikdən sonra bu ixracda görünür -- razılıq defolt olaraq deaktivdir və onu istənilən vaxt yenidən söndürə bilərsiniz. Əgər \"% 1-in kompüterləri veb-saytında göstərməlidir?\" seçimini də aktivləşdirmisinizsə, ixrac edilən kompüter qeydləriniz hesabınıza keçid də daxil edəcək. Komanda qeydləri bu razılıqla əhatə olunmur: krediti olan istənilən komanda, üzvlərinin tərcihlərindən asılı olmayaraq, təsisçinin hesab ID-si daxil olmaqla ixrac edilir.";
$language_lookup_array["ca"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Un cop al dia, %1 publica una instantània de les estadístiques de comptes, ordinadors i equips (nom d'usuari, país, crèdit, pertinença a equip i, per als ordinadors, detalls de maquinari i rendiment) com a fitxers descarregables a %2, per a l'ús de llocs de seguiment d'estadístiques de tot BOINC. Aquest és el comportament estàndard del propi programari BOINC: els fitxers són accessibles obertament per a qualsevol que els sol·liciti, independentment que un lloc d'estadístiques concret ho estigui fent ara mateix o no. La teva adreça de correu, contrasenya i dades d'autenticació mai s'hi inclouen. El teu compte i els teus ordinadors només apareixen en aquesta exportació un cop tens crèdit de càlcul i has activat \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" a les preferències del teu compte -- el consentiment està desactivat per defecte, i el pots desactivar de nou en qualsevol moment. Si també tens activat \"Pot Camicia mostrar els seus equips en el seu lloc web?\", els teus ordinadors exportats inclouran també un enllaç al teu compte. Les dades dels equips no estan cobertes per aquest consentiment: qualsevol equip amb crèdit s'exporta independentment de les preferències dels seus membres, inclòs l'ID de compte del fundador.";
$language_lookup_array["cs"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Jednou denně %1 zveřejňuje snímek statistik účtů, počítačů a týmů (uživatelské jméno, země, kredit, členství v týmu, a u počítačů podrobnosti o hardwaru a výkonu) jako soubory ke stažení na %2, k použití pro weby sledující statistiky BOINC. Toto je standardní chování samotného softwaru BOINC: soubory jsou volně dostupné komukoli nebo čemukoli, kdo je vyžádá, bez ohledu na to, zda to konkrétní web se statistikami aktuálně dělá. Vaše e-mailová adresa, heslo a přihlašovací údaje nejsou nikdy zahrnuty. Váš účet a počítače se v tomto exportu objeví až poté, co získáte nějaký výpočetní kredit a povolíte v nastavení účtu možnost \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" -- souhlas je ve výchozím stavu vypnutý a kdykoli jej můžete znovu vypnout. Pokud máte navíc povoleno \"Má Camicia zobrazovat vaše počítače na svých stránkách?\", exportované záznamy o počítačích budou navíc obsahovat odkaz zpět na váš účet. Údaje o týmech tímto souhlasem vůbec nejsou pokryty: jakýkoli tým s kreditem je exportován bez ohledu na preference svých členů, včetně ID účtu zakladatele.";
$language_lookup_array["de"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Einmal täglich veröffentlicht %1 eine Momentaufnahme der Konto-, Computer- und Teamstatistiken (Benutzername, Land, Guthaben, Teammitgliedschaft und bei Computern Hardware- und Leistungsdetails) als herunterladbare Dateien unter %2 zur Nutzung durch BOINC-weite Statistik-Tracking-Websites. Dies ist ein Standardverhalten der BOINC-Software selbst: Die Dateien sind offen für jeden zugänglich, der sie anfordert, unabhängig davon, ob eine bestimmte Statistik-Website dies gerade aktiv tut. Ihre E-Mail-Adresse, Ihr Passwort und Ihre Authentifizierungsdaten werden niemals einbezogen. Ihr Konto und Ihre Computer erscheinen in diesem Export erst, wenn Sie über etwas Rechen-Guthaben verfügen und in Ihren Kontoeinstellungen \"Stimmen Sie zu, dass Ihre Daten an BOINC Statistik Webseiten exportiert werden dürfen?\" aktiviert haben -- die Zustimmung ist standardmäßig deaktiviert, und Sie können sie jederzeit wieder ausschalten. Wenn Sie zusätzlich \"Sollen deine Computer auf der Camicia Webseite angezeigt werden?\" aktiviert haben, enthalten Ihre exportierten Computer-Datensätze zusätzlich einen Verweis auf Ihr Konto. Team-Daten sind von dieser Zustimmung überhaupt nicht erfasst: Jedes Team mit Guthaben wird unabhängig von den Einstellungen seiner Mitglieder exportiert, einschließlich der Konto-ID des Gründers.";
$language_lookup_array["es"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Una vez al día, %1 publica una instantánea de las estadísticas de cuentas, ordenadores y equipos (nombre de usuario, país, crédito, pertenencia a un equipo y, para los ordenadores, detalles de hardware y rendimiento) como archivos descargables en %2, para su uso por sitios de seguimiento de estadísticas de BOINC. Este es el comportamiento estándar del propio software BOINC: los archivos son accesibles abiertamente por cualquiera o cualquier cosa que los solicite, independientemente de que un sitio de estadísticas en particular lo esté haciendo activamente en este momento. Tu dirección de correo electrónico, contraseña y datos de autenticación nunca se incluyen. Tu cuenta y tus ordenadores solo aparecen en esta exportación una vez que tienes algo de crédito de cómputo y has activado \"¿Aceptas exportar tus datos a sitios web de agregación de estadísticas de BOINC?\" en las preferencias de tu cuenta -- el consentimiento está desactivado de forma predeterminada, y puedes desactivarlo de nuevo en cualquier momento. Si también tienes activado \"¿Debería Camicia mostrar sus computadoras en este sitio web?\", tus registros de ordenador exportados incluirán además un enlace a tu cuenta. Los datos de los equipos no están cubiertos por este consentimiento en absoluto: cualquier equipo con crédito se exporta independientemente de las preferencias de sus miembros, incluido el ID de cuenta del fundador.";
$language_lookup_array["eu"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Egunean behin, %1(e)k kontuen, ordenagailuen eta taldeen estatistiken argazki bat argitaratzen du (erabiltzaile-izena, herrialdea, kreditua, taldeko kidetza, eta ordenagailuentzat, hardware eta errendimendu xehetasunak) deskargatzeko moduko fitxategi gisa %2 helbidean, BOINC osoko estatistika-jarraipen guneek erabil ditzaten. Hau BOINC softwarearen berezko jokabidea da: fitxategiak edonork edo edozerk eska ditzake, unean une estatistika-gune jakin batek hala egiten duen edo ez kontuan hartu gabe. Zure helbide elektronikoa, pasahitza eta autentifikazio xehetasunak inoiz ez dira sartzen. Zure kontua eta ordenagailuak esportazio honetan agertzen dira konputazio-kreditu pixka bat izan eta zure kontuaren hobespenetan \"BOINCeko estatistikak batzen dituzten webguneetara zure datuak esportatzeko baimena ematen al duzu?\" aktibatu ondoren soilik -- baimena lehenespenez desaktibatuta dago, eta edonoiz desaktiba dezakezu berriro. \"Camiciak bere webgunean zure ordenagailuak bistaratu beharko al lituzke?\" ere aktibatuta baduzu, esportatutako ordenagailu-erregistroek zure kontura esteka bat ere izango dute. Talde-datuak ez daude baimen honen mende: kreditua duen edozein talde esportatzen da, bere kideen hobespenak edozein direla ere, sortzailearen kontu-IDa barne.";
$language_lookup_array["fi"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Kerran päivässä %1 julkaisee tilannekuvan tili-, tietokone- ja tiimitilastoista (käyttäjänimi, maa, hyvitys, tiimijäsenyys ja tietokoneiden osalta laitteisto- ja suoritustiedot) ladattavina tiedostoina osoitteessa %2, BOINC-laajuisten tilastoja seuraavien sivustojen käyttöön. Tämä on BOINC-ohjelmiston oma vakiotoiminta: tiedostot ovat avoimesti kenen tahansa tai minkä tahansa niitä pyytävän saatavilla, riippumatta siitä, tekeekö jokin tietty tilastosivusto niin juuri nyt. Sähköpostiosoitettasi, salasanaasi tai todennustietojasi ei koskaan sisällytetä. Tilisi ja tietokoneesi näkyvät tässä viennissä vasta, kun sinulla on jonkin verran laskentahyvitystä ja olet ottanut käyttöön tiliasetuksissasi kohdan \"Hyväksytkö tietojesi viennin BOINC-tilastojen yhdistämissivustoille?\" -- suostumus on oletuksena pois päältä, ja voit poistaa sen käytöstä uudelleen milloin tahansa. Jos sinulla on lisäksi käytössä \"Saako Camicia näyttää tietokoneesi nettisivullaan?\", viedyt tietokonetietueesi sisältävät myös linkin tilillesi. Tiimitiedot eivät kuulu tämän suostumuksen piiriin lainkaan: mikä tahansa hyvitystä saanut tiimi viedään sen jäsenten asetuksista riippumatta, mukaan lukien perustajan tilitunnus.";
$language_lookup_array["fr"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Une fois par jour, %1 publie un instantané des statistiques de compte, d'ordinateur et d'équipe (nom d'utilisateur, pays, crédit, appartenance à une équipe, et pour les ordinateurs, détails matériels et de performance) sous forme de fichiers téléchargeables à %2, destinés à être utilisés par des sites de suivi des statistiques BOINC. Il s'agit d'un comportement standard du logiciel BOINC lui-même : les fichiers sont librement accessibles à quiconque ou quoi que ce soit qui les demande, qu'un site de statistiques particulier le fasse activement en ce moment ou non. Votre adresse e-mail, votre mot de passe et vos informations d'authentification ne sont jamais inclus. Votre compte et vos ordinateurs n'apparaissent dans cet export qu'une fois que vous avez du crédit de calcul et que vous avez activé « Consentez-vous à exporter vos données sur des sites Web de statistiques BOINC ? » dans les préférences de votre compte -- le consentement est désactivé par défaut, et vous pouvez le désactiver à nouveau à tout moment. Si vous avez également activé « Acceptez-vous que Camicia affiche vos ordinateurs sur son site web ? », vos enregistrements d'ordinateurs exportés incluront aussi un lien vers votre compte. Les données d'équipe ne sont pas du tout couvertes par ce consentement : toute équipe ayant du crédit est exportée indépendamment des préférences de ses membres, y compris l'identifiant de compte du fondateur.";
$language_lookup_array["he"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "פעם ביום, %1 מפרסם תמונת מצב של סטטיסטיקות חשבון, מחשב וקבוצה (שם משתמש, מדינה, קרדיט, חברות בקבוצה, ועבור מחשבים, פרטי חומרה וביצועים) כקבצים להורדה בכתובת %2, לשימוש אתרי מעקב סטטיסטיקה ברחבי BOINC. זוהי התנהגות סטנדרטית של תוכנת BOINC עצמה: הקבצים נגישים באופן פתוח לכל אחד או כל דבר שמבקש אותם, בין אם אתר סטטיסטיקה מסוים עושה זאת כעת באופן פעיל ובין אם לא. כתובת הדוא\"ל, הסיסמה ופרטי האימות שלכם לעולם אינם נכללים. החשבון והמחשבים שלכם מופיעים בייצוא זה רק לאחר שיש לכם קרדיט חישוב כלשהו והפעלתם \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" בהעדפות החשבון שלכם -- ההסכמה כבויה כברירת מחדל, ותוכלו לכבות אותה שוב בכל עת. אם הפעלתם גם \"האם על Camicia להציג את מחשביך באתר שלו?\", רשומות המחשב שלכם בייצוא יכללו גם קישור בחזרה לחשבון שלכם. נתוני קבוצות אינם מכוסים כלל על ידי הסכמה זו: כל קבוצה בעלת קרדיט מיוצאת ללא קשר להעדפות חבריה, כולל מזהה החשבון של המייסד.";
$language_lookup_array["hu"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Naponta egyszer a %1 közzéteszi a fiók-, számítógép- és csapatstatisztikák pillanatképét (felhasználónév, ország, jóváírás, csapattagság, számítógépek esetén pedig hardver- és teljesítményadatok) letölthető fájlokként a %2 címen, a BOINC-szerte statisztikát követő oldalak számára. Ez a BOINC szoftver saját, alapértelmezett viselkedése: a fájlok nyíltan elérhetők bárki vagy bármi számára, aki kéri őket, függetlenül attól, hogy egy adott statisztikai oldal éppen aktívan teszi-e ezt. Az Ön e-mail-címe, jelszava és hitelesítési adatai soha nem szerepelnek benne. A fiókja és a számítógépei csak akkor jelennek meg ebben az exportban, ha már van némi számítási jóváírása, és engedélyezte a fiókbeállításaiban a \"Beleegyezik-e, hogy az ön adatait BOINC statisztikai oldalak használhassák?\" opciót -- a hozzájárulás alapértelmezetten ki van kapcsolva, és bármikor újra kikapcsolhatja. Ha emellett engedélyezve van a \"Megjelenítheti a(z) Camicia weboldalán a számítógépedet?\" opció is, az exportált számítógép-adatok tartalmazni fogják a fiókjára mutató hivatkozást is. A csapatadatokra egyáltalán nem vonatkozik ez a hozzájárulás: minden jóváírással rendelkező csapat exportálásra kerül a tagjai beállításaitól függetlenül, beleértve az alapító fiókazonosítóját is.";
$language_lookup_array["ja"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "%1は1日1回、アカウント、コンピューター、チームの統計情報(ユーザー名、国、クレジット、チーム所属、コンピューターについてはハードウェアと性能の詳細)のスナップショットを、BOINC全体の統計追跡サイトで利用できるようダウンロード可能なファイルとして%2で公開します。これはBOINCソフトウェア自体の標準的な動作です:特定の統計サイトが現在実際にそうしているかどうかにかかわらず、ファイルはそれを要求する誰でも、何でも自由にアクセスできます。メールアドレス、パスワード、認証情報が含まれることは決してありません。 あなたのアカウントとコンピューターは、計算クレジットを獲得し、アカウント設定で「あなたのデータをBOINCの統計集計サイトにエクスポートすることに同意しますか？」を有効にした場合にのみこのエクスポートに表示されます。同意はデフォルトで無効になっており、いつでも再度無効にできます。「Camicia があなたのコンピュータをこのウェブサイト上に表示してかまいませんか?」も有効になっている場合、エクスポートされるコンピューターの記録にはアカウントへのリンクも含まれます。チームのデータはこの同意の対象外です:クレジットのあるチームはメンバーの設定に関係なくエクスポートされ、創設者のアカウントIDも含まれます。";
$language_lookup_array["ko"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "%1은(는) 하루에 한 번씩 계정, 컴퓨터, 팀 통계(사용자 이름, 국가, 크레딧, 팀 소속, 컴퓨터의 경우 하드웨어 및 성능 세부 정보)의 스냅샷을 %2에서 다운로드 가능한 파일로 게시하여 BOINC 전역 통계 추적 사이트에서 사용할 수 있도록 합니다. 이는 BOINC 소프트웨어 자체의 표준 동작입니다: 특정 통계 사이트가 현재 실제로 요청하고 있는지 여부와 관계없이 파일은 누구나 또는 무엇이든 요청하면 공개적으로 접근할 수 있습니다. 이메일 주소, 비밀번호, 인증 정보는 절대 포함되지 않습니다. 귀하의 계정과 컴퓨터는 계산 크레딧이 어느 정도 있고 계정 환경설정에서 \"BOINC 통계 집합 웹사이트로 사용자 데이터를 반출하는 것을 허용하시겠습니까?\"를 활성화한 경우에만 이 내보내기에 나타납니다. 동의는 기본적으로 꺼져 있으며 언제든지 다시 끌 수 있습니다. \"Camicia이 여러분 컴퓨터를 웹 사이트에 공개하도록 하시겠습니까?\"도 활성화한 경우, 내보내진 컴퓨터 기록에는 귀하의 계정으로 연결되는 링크도 포함됩니다. 팀 데이터는 이 동의의 적용을 전혀 받지 않습니다: 크레딧이 있는 모든 팀은 구성원의 설정과 관계없이 내보내지며, 여기에는 창립자의 계정 ID도 포함됩니다.";
$language_lookup_array["nb"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Én gang om dagen publiserer %1 et øyeblikksbilde av konto-, datamaskin- og lagstatistikk (brukernavn, land, kreditt, lagmedlemskap, og for datamaskiner, maskinvare- og ytelsesdetaljer) som nedlastbare filer på %2, til bruk for BOINC-omfattende statistikksporingsnettsteder. Dette er standardoppførsel for selve BOINC-programvaren: filene er åpent tilgjengelige for hvem eller hva som helst som ber om dem, uansett om et bestemt statistikknettsted aktivt gjør det akkurat nå. E-postadressen, passordet og autentiseringsdetaljene dine er aldri inkludert. Kontoen og datamaskinene dine vises først i denne eksporten når du har litt beregningskreditt og har aktivert \"Samtykker du i å eksportere dataene dine til BOINC-statistikkaggregasjonsnettsteder?\" i kontoinnstillingene dine -- samtykke er skrudd av som standard, og du kan skru det av igjen når som helst. Hvis du også har aktivert \"Skal Camicia vise dine datamaskiner på sin hjemmeside?\", vil de eksporterte datamaskinpostene dine i tillegg inneholde en lenke tilbake til kontoen din. Lagdata er ikke dekket av dette samtykket i det hele tatt: ethvert lag med kreditt eksporteres uavhengig av medlemmenes preferanser, inkludert grunnleggerens konto-ID.";
$language_lookup_array["nl"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Eén keer per dag publiceert %1 een momentopname van account-, computer- en teamstatistieken (gebruikersnaam, land, credit, teamlidmaatschap, en voor computers hardware- en prestatiedetails) als downloadbare bestanden op %2, voor gebruik door BOINC-brede statistiek-trackingsites. Dit is standaardgedrag van de BOINC-software zelf: de bestanden zijn openlijk toegankelijk voor iedereen of alles wat erom vraagt, ongeacht of een bepaalde statistieksite dit nu actief doet. Je e-mailadres, wachtwoord en authenticatiegegevens worden nooit opgenomen. Je account en computers verschijnen pas in deze export zodra je wat rekenkrediet hebt en \"Stem je erin toe jouw gegevens te exporteren naar BOINC statistieken-aggregatie websites?\" hebt ingeschakeld in je accountvoorkeuren -- toestemming staat standaard uit, en je kunt het op elk moment weer uitschakelen. Als je ook \"Wil je dat Camicia jouw computers laat zien op de website?\" hebt ingeschakeld, bevatten je geëxporteerde computergegevens ook een link terug naar je account. Teamgegevens vallen helemaal niet onder deze toestemming: elk team met credit wordt geëxporteerd ongeacht de voorkeuren van de leden, inclusief het account-ID van de oprichter.";
$language_lookup_array["pl"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Raz dziennie %1 publikuje migawkę statystyk konta, komputera i zespołu (nazwa użytkownika, kraj, kredyt, przynależność do zespołu, a dla komputerów szczegóły sprzętowe i wydajnościowe) jako pliki do pobrania pod adresem %2, do wykorzystania przez ogólnodostępne witryny śledzące statystyki BOINC. Jest to standardowe zachowanie samego oprogramowania BOINC: pliki są swobodnie dostępne dla każdego lub czegokolwiek, kto o nie poprosi, niezależnie od tego, czy konkretna witryna statystyczna aktualnie to robi. Twój adres e-mail, hasło i dane uwierzytelniające nigdy nie są uwzględniane. Twoje konto i komputery pojawiają się w tym eksporcie dopiero, gdy masz jakikolwiek kredyt obliczeniowy i włączyłeś w preferencjach konta opcję \"Czy zgadzasz się na eksport swoich danych na strony generujące statystyki BOINC?\" -- zgoda jest domyślnie wyłączona i możesz ją ponownie wyłączyć w dowolnym momencie. Jeśli masz również włączoną opcję \"Czy Camicia powinien wyświetlać twoje komputery na swojej stronie?\", eksportowane rekordy komputerów będą dodatkowo zawierać odnośnik do twojego konta. Dane zespołów w ogóle nie są objęte tą zgodą: każdy zespół z kredytem jest eksportowany niezależnie od preferencji jego członków, łącznie z identyfikatorem konta założyciela.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_BR"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Uma vez por dia, o %1 publica um instantâneo das estatísticas de conta, computador e equipe (nome de usuário, país, crédito, associação a equipe e, para computadores, detalhes de hardware e desempenho) como arquivos para download em %2, para uso por sites de rastreamento de estatísticas de todo o BOINC. Este é o comportamento padrão do próprio software BOINC: os arquivos ficam abertamente acessíveis a qualquer pessoa ou coisa que os solicite, independentemente de um site de estatísticas específico estar fazendo isso ativamente agora. Seu endereço de e-mail, senha e dados de autenticação nunca são incluídos. Sua conta e seus computadores só aparecem nessa exportação depois que você tiver algum crédito computacional e tiver ativado \"Você concorda em compartilhar seus dados com os sites de agregação de estatísticas BOINC?\" nas preferências da sua conta -- o consentimento fica desativado por padrão, e você pode desativá-lo novamente a qualquer momento. Se você também tiver ativado \"Pode Camicia mostrar seus computadores em seu web site?\", seus registros de computador exportados também incluirão um link de volta para sua conta. Os dados de equipe não são cobertos por esse consentimento de forma alguma: qualquer equipe com crédito é exportada independentemente das preferências de seus membros, incluindo o ID de conta do fundador.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_PT"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Uma vez por dia, o %1 publica uma captura das estatísticas de conta, computador e equipa (nome de utilizador, país, crédito, associação a equipa e, para computadores, detalhes de hardware e desempenho) como ficheiros descarregáveis em %2, para uso por sites de monitorização de estatísticas de todo o BOINC. Este é o comportamento padrão do próprio software BOINC: os ficheiros estão abertamente acessíveis a qualquer pessoa ou coisa que os solicite, quer um site de estatísticas específico o esteja a fazer ativamente neste momento ou não. O seu endereço de e-mail, palavra-passe e dados de autenticação nunca são incluídos. A sua conta e os seus computadores só aparecem nesta exportação depois de ter algum crédito computacional e de ter ativado \"Concorda em exportar os seus dados para websites de agregação de estatísticas do BOINC?\" nas preferências da sua conta -- o consentimento está desativado por predefinição, e pode desativá-lo novamente a qualquer momento. Se também tiver ativado \"Deve o Camicia mostrar os seus computadores no seu website?\", os seus registos de computador exportados incluirão também uma ligação de volta à sua conta. Os dados de equipa não estão de todo cobertos por este consentimento: qualquer equipa com crédito é exportada independentemente das preferências dos seus membros, incluindo o ID de conta do fundador.";
$language_lookup_array["ru"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Раз в день %1 публикует снимок статистики учётных записей, компьютеров и команд (имя пользователя, страна, кредит, членство в команде, а для компьютеров -- сведения об оборудовании и производительности) в виде файлов для скачивания по адресу %2, для использования сайтами отслеживания статистики BOINC. Это стандартное поведение самого ПО BOINC: файлы открыто доступны любому, кто их запрашивает, независимо от того, делает ли это конкретный сайт статистики прямо сейчас. Ваш адрес электронной почты, пароль и данные аутентификации никогда не включаются. Ваша учётная запись и компьютеры появляются в этом экспорте только после того, как у вас появится некоторый вычислительный кредит и вы включите в настройках учётной записи опцию \"Согласны ли Вы экспортировать свои данные на веб-сайты объединённой статистики BOINC?\" -- согласие по умолчанию выключено, и вы можете снова отключить его в любой момент. Если у вас также включена опция \"Должен ли Camicia показывать ваши компьютеры на своём веб-сайте?\", экспортируемые записи о компьютерах будут дополнительно содержать ссылку на вашу учётную запись. Данные команд вообще не охватываются этим согласием: любая команда с кредитом экспортируется независимо от настроек её участников, включая ID учётной записи основателя.";
$language_lookup_array["sk"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Raz denne %1 zverejňuje snímku štatistík účtov, počítačov a tímov (používateľské meno, krajina, kredit, členstvo v tíme a pri počítačoch podrobnosti o hardvéri a výkone) ako súbory na stiahnutie na adrese %2, na použitie webmi sledujúcimi štatistiky BOINC. Toto je štandardné správanie samotného softvéru BOINC: súbory sú voľne dostupné komukoľvek alebo čomukoľvek, kto si ich vyžiada, bez ohľadu na to, či to konkrétny štatistický web aktuálne robí. Vaša e-mailová adresa, heslo a overovacie údaje nie sú nikdy zahrnuté. Váš účet a počítače sa v tomto exporte zobrazia až po tom, čo získate nejaký výpočtový kredit a povolíte v predvoľbách účtu možnosť \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" -- súhlas je predvolene vypnutý a kedykoľvek ho môžete znova vypnúť. Ak máte navyše povolené \"Môže Camicia zobraziť vaše počítače na svojej stránke?\", exportované záznamy o počítačoch budú navyše obsahovať odkaz späť na váš účet. Údaje o tímoch týmto súhlasom vôbec nie sú pokryté: akýkoľvek tím s kreditom je exportovaný bez ohľadu na preferencie svojich členov, vrátane ID účtu zakladateľa.";
$language_lookup_array["sv"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "En gång om dagen publicerar %1 en ögonblicksbild av konto-, dator- och lagstatistik (användarnamn, land, poäng, lagmedlemskap och för datorer, hårdvaru- och prestandadetaljer) som nedladdningsbara filer på %2, för användning av BOINC-omfattande statistikspårningswebbplatser. Detta är standardbeteende för själva BOINC-programvaran: filerna är öppet tillgängliga för vem eller vad som helst som begär dem, oavsett om en viss statistikwebbplats aktivt gör det just nu. Din e-postadress, ditt lösenord och dina autentiseringsuppgifter inkluderas aldrig. Ditt konto och dina datorer visas i denna export först när du har lite beräkningspoäng och har aktiverat \"Godkänner du att din data exporteras till BOINC statistiksidor?\" i dina kontoinställningar -- samtycket är avstängt som standard, och du kan stänga av det igen när som helst. Om du också har aktiverat \"Ska Camicia visa dina datorer på dess webbplats?\" kommer dina exporterade datorposter dessutom att innehålla en länk tillbaka till ditt konto. Lagdata omfattas inte alls av detta samtycke: alla lag med poäng exporteras oavsett medlemmarnas inställningar, inklusive grundarens konto-ID.";
$language_lookup_array["tr"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "%1, günde bir kez hesap, bilgisayar ve takım istatistiklerinin (kullanıcı adı, ülke, kredi, takım üyeliği ve bilgisayarlar için donanım ve performans ayrıntıları) bir anlık görüntüsünü, BOINC genelindeki istatistik izleme siteleri tarafından kullanılmak üzere %2 adresinde indirilebilir dosyalar olarak yayınlar. Bu, BOINC yazılımının kendisinin standart davranışıdır: belirli bir istatistik sitesi şu anda aktif olarak bunu yapıyor olsun ya da olmasın, dosyalar bunları talep eden herkes veya her şey tarafından açıkça erişilebilir. E-posta adresiniz, şifreniz ve kimlik doğrulama bilgileriniz asla dahil edilmez. Hesabınız ve bilgisayarlarınız, yalnızca bir miktar hesaplama kredisine sahip olduğunuzda ve hesap tercihlerinizde \"Verilerinizi BOINC istatistik toplama Web sitelerine aktarmayı kabul ediyor musunuz?\" seçeneğini etkinleştirdiğinizde bu dışa aktarımda görünür -- onay varsayılan olarak kapalıdır ve istediğiniz zaman tekrar kapatabilirsiniz. Ayrıca \"Camicia, projeye katıldığınız bilgisayarları bu internet sitesi üzerinde göstersin mi?\" seçeneğini de etkinleştirdiyseniz, dışa aktarılan bilgisayar kayıtlarınız hesabınıza bir bağlantı da içerecektir. Takım verileri bu onay kapsamında hiç değildir: krediti olan herhangi bir takım, üyelerinin tercihlerinden bağımsız olarak, kurucunun hesap kimliği dahil olmak üzere dışa aktarılır.";
$language_lookup_array["uk"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Раз на день %1 публікує знімок статистики облікових записів, комп'ютерів і команд (ім'я користувача, країна, кредит, членство в команді, а для комп'ютерів -- відомості про обладнання та продуктивність) у вигляді файлів для завантаження за адресою %2, для використання сайтами відстеження статистики BOINC. Це стандартна поведінка самого ПЗ BOINC: файли відкрито доступні будь-кому, хто їх запитує, незалежно від того, чи робить це конкретний сайт статистики прямо зараз. Ваша електронна адреса, пароль і дані автентифікації ніколи не включаються. Ваш обліковий запис і комп'ютери з'являються в цьому експорті лише після того, як у вас з'явиться певний обчислювальний кредит і ви увімкнете в налаштуваннях облікового запису опцію \"Чи згодні ви експортувати свої дані для агрегації статистики на веб-сайти BOINC?\" -- згода за замовчуванням вимкнена, і ви можете знову вимкнути її в будь-який момент. Якщо у вас також увімкнено \"Чи повинен Camicia показувати Ваші комп'ютери на своєму веб-сайті?\", експортовані записи про комп'ютери додатково міститимуть посилання на ваш обліковий запис. Дані команд взагалі не охоплюються цією згодою: будь-яка команда з кредитом експортується незалежно від налаштувань її учасників, включно з ID облікового запису засновника.";
$language_lookup_array["vi"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "Mỗi ngày một lần, %1 công bố ảnh chụp nhanh số liệu thống kê tài khoản, máy tính và nhóm (tên người dùng, quốc gia, credit, tư cách thành viên nhóm, và đối với máy tính là thông tin phần cứng và hiệu năng) dưới dạng tệp có thể tải xuống tại %2, để các trang theo dõi thống kê BOINC sử dụng. Đây là hành vi tiêu chuẩn của chính phần mềm BOINC: các tệp này công khai cho bất kỳ ai hoặc bất cứ thứ gì yêu cầu, bất kể một trang thống kê cụ thể có đang thực sự làm vậy hay không. Địa chỉ email, mật khẩu và thông tin xác thực của bạn không bao giờ được đưa vào. Tài khoản và máy tính của bạn chỉ xuất hiện trong bản xuất này sau khi bạn có credit tính toán và đã bật \"Bạn có đồng ý xuất dữ liệu của mình sang các trang Web tổng hợp thống kê BOINC không?\" trong tùy chọn tài khoản của bạn -- sự đồng ý mặc định bị tắt, và bạn có thể tắt lại bất kỳ lúc nào. Nếu bạn cũng bật \"Camicia có nên hiển thị các máy tính của bạn trên trang web của họ không?\", bản ghi máy tính được xuất của bạn sẽ bao gồm thêm liên kết trở lại tài khoản của bạn. Dữ liệu nhóm hoàn toàn không thuộc phạm vi của sự đồng ý này: bất kỳ nhóm nào có credit đều được xuất bất kể tùy chọn của các thành viên, bao gồm cả ID tài khoản của người sáng lập.";
$language_lookup_array["zh_CN"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "%1每天发布一次账户、计算机和团队统计信息的快照(用户名、国家/地区、积分、团队归属,以及计算机的硬件和性能详情),以可下载文件的形式发布在%2,供BOINC范围内的统计追踪网站使用。这是BOINC软件本身的标准行为:无论某个特定统计网站当前是否在实际获取,任何人或任何程序请求这些文件都可以公开访问。您的电子邮箱地址、密码和身份验证信息绝不会包含在内。只有当您获得一些计算积分并在账户偏好设置中启用了\"您是否同意将数据分享到BOINC统计聚合网站？\"后，您的账户和计算机才会出现在此导出中——该同意选项默认关闭，您可以随时再次关闭它。如果您还启用了\"Camicia 是否可以将你的计算机显示在它的网站上？\"，导出的计算机记录还将包含指向您账户的链接。团队数据完全不受此同意选项约束：任何有积分的团队都会被导出，无论其成员的偏好设置如何，包括创建者的账户ID。";
$language_lookup_array["zh_TW"]["Once a day, %1 publishes a snapshot of account, computer, and team statistics (username, country, credit, team membership, and for computers, hardware and performance details) as downloadable files at %2, for use by BOINC-wide statistics tracking sites. This is standard behavior of the BOINC software itself: the files are openly reachable by anyone or anything that requests them, whether or not a particular statistics site is actively doing so right now. Your email address, password, and authentication details are never included. Your account and computers only appear in this export once you have some computing credit and have enabled \"Do you consent to exporting your data to BOINC statistics aggregation Web sites?\" in your account preferences -- consent is off by default, and you can turn it off again at any time. If you also have \"Should %1 show your computers on its web site?\" enabled, your exported computer records additionally include a link back to your account. Team records are not covered by this consent at all: any team with credit is exported regardless of its members' preferences, including the founder's account ID."] = "%1每天發布一次帳戶、電腦和團隊統計資訊的快照(使用者名稱、國家/地區、積分、團隊歸屬,以及電腦的硬體和效能詳情),以可下載檔案的形式發布在%2,供BOINC範圍內的統計追蹤網站使用。這是BOINC軟體本身的標準行為:無論某個特定統計網站目前是否實際在擷取,任何人或任何程式請求這些檔案都可以公開存取。您的電子郵件地址、密碼和身分驗證資訊絕不會包含在內。只有當您獲得一些計算積分並在帳戶偏好設定中啟用了\"您是否同意將數據分享到BOINC統計聚合網站？\"後，您的帳戶和電腦才會出現在此匯出中——該同意選項預設關閉，您可以隨時再次關閉它。如果您還啟用了\"Camicia是否可以將您的電腦顯示在它的網站上?\"，匯出的電腦記錄還將包含指向您帳戶的連結。團隊資料完全不受此同意選項約束：任何有積分的團隊都會被匯出，無論其成員的偏好設定如何，包括創建者的帳戶ID。";
