$language_lookup_array["it_IT"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "Il database del progetto -- comprese le informazioni sull'account, i dettagli dei computer, i messaggi del forum e i messaggi privati, non solo i risultati computazionali -- viene sottoposto a backup giornaliero su Google Drive e su un'unità locale fisicamente separata, così il progetto può recuperare da un guasto hardware o da un server compromesso. I backup non vengono utilizzati per nessun altro scopo e non sono accessibili a nessuno tranne l'operatore del progetto.";
$language_lookup_array["az"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "Layihənin verilənlər bazası -- hesab məlumatları, kompüter təfərrüatları, forum yazıları və şəxsi mesajlar daxil olmaqla, təkcə hesablama nəticələri deyil -- hər gün Google Drive-a və fiziki olaraq ayrı yerli diskə ehtiyat nüsxələnir, beləliklə layihə avadanlıq nasazlığından və ya təhlükəyə məruz qalmış serverdən bərpa oluna bilər. Ehtiyat nüsxələr başqa heç bir məqsəd üçün istifadə olunmur və layihə operatorundan başqa heç kim onlara çıxış edə bilməz.";
$language_lookup_array["ca"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "La base de dades del projecte -- incloent-hi informació de comptes, detalls d'ordinadors, missatges del fòrum i missatges privats, no només resultats computacionals -- es copia de seguretat diàriament a Google Drive i a una unitat local físicament separada, perquè el projecte es pugui recuperar d'una fallada de maquinari o d'un servidor compromès. Les còpies de seguretat no s'usen per a cap altre propòsit i no són accessibles per a ningú excepte l'operador del projecte.";
$language_lookup_array["cs"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "Databáze projektu -- včetně informací o účtech, podrobností o počítačích, příspěvků na fóru a soukromých zpráv, nejen výpočetních výsledků -- se denně zálohuje na Google Drive a na fyzicky oddělený místní disk, aby se projekt mohl zotavit z hardwarové poruchy nebo napadeného serveru. Zálohy se nepoužívají k žádnému jinému účelu a nejsou přístupné nikomu kromě provozovatele projektu.";
$language_lookup_array["de"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "Die Datenbank des Projekts -- einschließlich Kontoinformationen, Computerdetails, Forenbeiträgen und privaten Nachrichten, nicht nur Berechnungsergebnissen -- wird täglich auf Google Drive und ein physisch getrenntes lokales Laufwerk gesichert, damit sich das Projekt von einem Hardwareausfall oder einem kompromittierten Server erholen kann. Backups werden zu keinem anderen Zweck verwendet und sind für niemanden außer dem Projektbetreiber zugänglich.";
$language_lookup_array["es"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "La base de datos del proyecto -- incluida la información de la cuenta, los detalles del ordenador, los mensajes del foro y los mensajes privados, no solo los resultados computacionales -- se respalda diariamente en Google Drive y en una unidad local físicamente separada, para que el proyecto pueda recuperarse de un fallo de hardware o de un servidor comprometido. Las copias de seguridad no se usan para ningún otro propósito y no son accesibles para nadie excepto el operador del proyecto.";
$language_lookup_array["eu"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "Proiektuaren datu-basea -- kontuaren informazioa, ordenagailuen xehetasunak, foroko mezuak eta mezu pribatuak barne, ez soilik konputazio-emaitzak -- egunero babesten da Google Drive-n eta fisikoki bereizitako tokiko unitate batean, proiektua hardware-hutsegite edo arriskuan jarritako zerbitzari batetik berreskura dadin. Babeskopiak ez dira beste inolako helbururako erabiltzen eta ez daude proiektuaren operadoreaz gain inorentzat eskuragarri.";
$language_lookup_array["fi"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "Projektin tietokanta -- mukaan lukien tilitiedot, tietokoneiden tiedot, keskusteluviestit ja yksityisviestit, ei pelkästään laskennallisia tuloksia -- varmuuskopioidaan päivittäin Google Driveen ja fyysisesti erilliselle paikalliselle asemalle, jotta projekti voi toipua laitteistovioista tai vaarantuneesta palvelimesta. Varmuuskopioita ei käytetä mihinkään muuhun tarkoitukseen, eivätkä ne ole kenenkään muun kuin projektin ylläpitäjän saatavilla.";
$language_lookup_array["fr"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "La base de données du projet -- y compris les informations de compte, les détails des ordinateurs, les messages du forum et les messages privés, pas seulement les résultats de calcul -- est sauvegardée quotidiennement sur Google Drive et sur un disque local physiquement séparé, afin que le projet puisse se remettre d'une panne matérielle ou d'un serveur compromis. Les sauvegardes ne sont utilisées à aucune autre fin et ne sont accessibles à personne d'autre qu'à l'opérateur du projet.";
$language_lookup_array["he"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "מסד הנתונים של הפרויקט -- כולל מידע על חשבונות, פרטי מחשבים, הודעות פורום והודעות פרטיות, לא רק תוצאות חישוביות -- מגובה מדי יום ל-Google Drive ולכונן מקומי נפרד פיזית, כדי שהפרויקט יוכל להתאושש מכשל חומרה או משרת שנפרץ. הגיבויים אינם משמשים לשום מטרה אחרת ואינם נגישים לאף אחד מלבד מפעיל הפרויקט.";
$language_lookup_array["hu"]["The project's database -- including account information, computer details, forum posts, and private messages, not just computational results -- is backed up daily to Google Drive and to a physically separate local drive, so the project can recover from hardware failure or a compromised server. Backups are not used for any other purpose and are not accessible to anyone but the project operator."] = "A projekt adatbázisáról -- beleértve a fiókinformációkat, számítógép-adatokat, fórumbejegyzéseket és privát üzeneteket, nem csak a számítási eredményeket -- naponta biztonsági mentés készül a Google Drive-ra és egy fizikailag különálló helyi meghajtóra, hogy a projekt helyre tudjon állni hardverhiba vagy feltört szerver esetén. A biztonsági mentéseket semmilyen más célra nem használjuk, és a projekt üzemeltetőjén kívül senki számára nem elérhetők.";
