$language_lookup_array["it_IT"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "I dati dell'account e dei computer vengono conservati finché il tuo account è attivo. Se elimini il tuo account, viene cancellato completamente e irreversibilmente -- non solo disattivato -- insieme ai tuoi computer, messaggi del forum, messaggi privati, cronologia crediti e profilo. Un piccolo record pseudonimo (solo un ID interno e una data, nessuna informazione personale) viene conservato fino a 60 giorni dopo, così altri progetti BOINC di cui fai parte possono essere notificati della cancellazione, dopodiché viene rimosso automaticamente anche quello. I backup effettuati prima di una cancellazione potrebbero comunque contenere i tuoi dati finché non vengono a loro volta ruotati.";
$language_lookup_array["az"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Hesab və kompüter məlumatları hesabınız aktiv olduğu müddətdə saxlanılır. Hesabınızı silsəniz, o, sadəcə deaktiv edilmir -- kompüterləriniz, forum yazılarınız, şəxsi mesajlarınız, kredit tarixçəniz və profiliniz ilə birlikdə tam və geri dönməz şəkildə silinir. Kiçik bir psevdonim qeyd (yalnız daxili ID və vaxt möhürü, heç bir şəxsi məlumat olmadan) sonradan 60 günə qədər saxlanılır ki, iştirakçısı olduğunuz digər BOINC layihələri silinmə barədə xəbərdar edilə bilsin, sonra o da avtomatik silinir. Silinmədən əvvəl götürülmüş ehtiyat nüsxələr onlar özləri dövriyyədən çıxarılana qədər hələ də məlumatlarınızı ehtiva edə bilər.";
$language_lookup_array["ca"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Les dades del compte i de l'ordinador es conserven mentre el teu compte estigui actiu. Si elimines el teu compte, s'esborra completament i de manera irreversible -- no només es desactiva -- juntament amb els teus ordinadors, missatges del fòrum, missatges privats, historial de crèdit i perfil. Es conserva un petit registre pseudònim (només un ID intern i una marca de temps, sense informació personal) fins a 60 dies després perquè altres projectes BOINC dels quals també formes part puguin ser notificats de l'eliminació, i llavors també s'elimina automàticament. Les còpies de seguretat fetes abans d'una eliminació poden encara contenir les teves dades fins que elles mateixes es rotin.";
$language_lookup_array["cs"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Údaje o účtu a počítači se uchovávají po dobu, kdy je váš účet aktivní. Pokud svůj účet smažete, je zcela a nevratně vymazán -- nejen deaktivován -- spolu s vašimi počítači, příspěvky na fóru, soukromými zprávami, historií kreditů a profilem. Malý pseudonymní záznam (jen interní ID a časové razítko, žádné osobní údaje) se uchovává až 60 dní poté, aby mohly být o smazání informovány další projekty BOINC, kterých jste také součástí, poté je automaticky odstraněn i on. Zálohy pořízené před smazáním mohou stále obsahovat vaše údaje, dokud nejsou samy nahrazeny novějšími.";
$language_lookup_array["de"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Konto- und Computerdaten werden so lange aufbewahrt, wie Ihr Konto aktiv ist. Wenn Sie Ihr Konto löschen, wird es vollständig und unwiderruflich gelöscht -- nicht nur deaktiviert -- zusammen mit Ihren Computern, Forenbeiträgen, privaten Nachrichten, Guthabenverlauf und Profil. Ein kleiner pseudonymer Eintrag (nur eine interne ID und ein Zeitstempel, keine personenbezogenen Daten) wird danach bis zu 60 Tage aufbewahrt, damit andere BOINC-Projekte, an denen Sie ebenfalls teilnehmen, über die Löschung informiert werden können, danach wird auch dieser automatisch entfernt. Backups, die vor einer Löschung erstellt wurden, können Ihre Daten noch enthalten, bis sie selbst ausgetauscht werden.";
$language_lookup_array["es"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Los datos de la cuenta y del ordenador se conservan mientras tu cuenta esté activa. Si eliminas tu cuenta, se borra completa e irreversiblemente -- no solo se desactiva -- junto con tus ordenadores, mensajes del foro, mensajes privados, historial de crédito y perfil. Se conserva un pequeño registro seudónimo (solo un ID interno y una marca de tiempo, sin información personal) hasta 60 días después para que otros proyectos BOINC de los que también formas parte puedan ser notificados de la eliminación, luego este también se elimina automáticamente. Las copias de seguridad realizadas antes de una eliminación pueden seguir conteniendo tus datos hasta que ellas mismas se roten.";
$language_lookup_array["eu"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Kontuaren eta ordenagailuaren datuak zure kontua aktibo dagoen bitartean gordetzen dira. Zure kontua ezabatzen baduzu, guztiz eta itzulezinki ezabatzen da -- ez soilik desaktibatu -- zure ordenagailuak, foroko mezuak, mezu pribatuak, kreditu-historia eta profila ere batera. Erregistro pseudonimo txiki bat (barne ID bat eta data-zigilua soilik, informazio pertsonalik gabe) gehienez 60 egunez gordetzen da ondoren, parte zaren beste BOINC proiektuei ezabapenaren berri eman ahal izateko, gero hori ere automatikoki kentzen da. Ezabapen baten aurretik egindako babeskopiek zure datuak izan ditzakete oraindik ere haiek berak errotatu arte.";
$language_lookup_array["fi"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Tili- ja tietokonetiedot säilytetään niin kauan kuin tilisi on aktiivinen. Jos poistat tilisi, se pyyhitään kokonaan ja peruuttamattomasti -- ei vain poisteta käytöstä -- yhdessä tietokoneidesi, keskusteluviestiesi, yksityisviestiesi, hyvityshistoriasi ja profiilisi kanssa. Pieni pseudonyymi tietue (vain sisäinen tunniste ja aikaleima, ei henkilötietoja) säilytetään enintään 60 päivää sen jälkeen, jotta muille BOINC-projekteille, joihin myös kuulut, voidaan ilmoittaa poistosta, minkä jälkeen sekin poistetaan automaattisesti. Ennen poistoa otetut varmuuskopiot voivat yhä sisältää tietojasi, kunnes ne itse korvataan uusilla.";
$language_lookup_array["fr"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Les données de compte et d'ordinateur sont conservées tant que votre compte est actif. Si vous supprimez votre compte, il est effacé complètement et irréversiblement -- pas simplement désactivé -- ainsi que vos ordinateurs, messages du forum, messages privés, historique de crédit et profil. Un petit enregistrement pseudonyme (juste un identifiant interne et un horodatage, aucune information personnelle) est conservé jusqu'à 60 jours après, afin que les autres projets BOINC dont vous faites également partie puissent être informés de la suppression, puis il est lui aussi supprimé automatiquement. Les sauvegardes effectuées avant une suppression peuvent encore contenir vos données jusqu'à ce qu'elles soient elles-mêmes remplacées.";
$language_lookup_array["he"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "נתוני חשבון ומחשב נשמרים כל עוד החשבון שלכם פעיל. אם תמחקו את החשבון שלכם, הוא נמחק לחלוטין ובאופן בלתי הפיך -- ולא רק מושבת -- יחד עם המחשבים שלכם, הודעות הפורום, הודעות פרטיות, היסטוריית קרדיט ופרופיל. רשומה פסבדונימית קטנה (רק מזהה פנימי וחותמת זמן, ללא מידע אישי) נשמרת עד 60 יום לאחר מכן כדי שפרויקטי BOINC אחרים שאתם חברים בהם יוכלו לקבל הודעה על המחיקה, ואז גם היא מוסרת אוטומטית. גיבויים שנעשו לפני מחיקה עשויים עדיין להכיל את הנתונים שלכם עד שהם עצמם מוחלפים בגיבויים חדשים.";
$language_lookup_array["hu"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "A fiók- és számítógépadatokat addig őrizzük, amíg fiókja aktív. Ha törli fiókját, az teljesen és visszavonhatatlanul törlődik -- nem csupán deaktiválódik -- a számítógépeivel, fórumbejegyzéseivel, privát üzeneteivel, jóváírási előzményeivel és profiljával együtt. Egy kis álnevesített rekordot (csak egy belső azonosítót és időbélyeget, semmilyen személyes adatot) legfeljebb 60 napig őrzünk meg utána, hogy más BOINC-projektek, amelyeknek szintén tagja, értesülhessenek a törlésről, majd ezt is automatikusan eltávolítjuk. A törlés előtt készített biztonsági mentések még tartalmazhatják adatait, amíg maguk is le nem cserélődnek.";
$language_lookup_array["ja"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "アカウントとコンピューターのデータは、アカウントが有効である限り保持されます。アカウントを削除すると、単に無効化されるのではなく、コンピューター、フォーラム投稿、プライベートメッセージ、クレジット履歴、プロフィールとともに完全かつ不可逆的に消去されます。小さな仮名化された記録(内部IDとタイムスタンプのみ、個人情報は含まれません)は、あなたが参加している他のBOINCプロジェクトに削除を通知できるよう、その後最大60日間保持され、その後自動的に削除されます。削除前に取得されたバックアップには、それ自体が入れ替わるまでデータが残っている場合があります。";
$language_lookup_array["ko"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "계정 및 컴퓨터 데이터는 계정이 활성 상태인 동안 유지됩니다. 계정을 삭제하면 단순히 비활성화되는 것이 아니라 컴퓨터, 포럼 게시물, 개인 메시지, 크레딧 기록, 프로필과 함께 완전하고 되돌릴 수 없게 삭제됩니다. 작은 가명 처리된 기록(내부 ID와 타임스탬프만, 개인정보 없음)이 이후 최대 60일간 보관되어 귀하가 소속된 다른 BOINC 프로젝트에 삭제 사실을 알릴 수 있도록 하며, 그 후 이 기록도 자동으로 제거됩니다. 삭제 전에 수행된 백업에는 백업 자체가 교체될 때까지 여전히 데이터가 포함되어 있을 수 있습니다.";
$language_lookup_array["nb"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Konto- og datamaskindata beholdes så lenge kontoen din er aktiv. Hvis du sletter kontoen din, blir den fullstendig og ugjenkallelig slettet -- ikke bare deaktivert -- sammen med datamaskinene dine, foruminnlegg, private meldinger, kreditthistorikk og profil. En liten pseudonym post (bare en intern ID og tidsstempel, ingen personopplysninger) beholdes i opptil 60 dager etterpå, slik at andre BOINC-prosjekter du også er en del av kan varsles om slettingen, deretter fjernes også den automatisk. Sikkerhetskopier tatt før en sletting kan fortsatt inneholde dataene dine helt til de selv roteres ut.";
$language_lookup_array["nl"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Account- en computergegevens worden bewaard zolang je account actief is. Als je je account verwijdert, wordt deze volledig en onomkeerbaar gewist -- niet alleen gedeactiveerd -- samen met je computers, forumberichten, privéberichten, creditgeschiedenis en profiel. Een klein pseudoniem record (alleen een interne ID en tijdstempel, geen persoonlijke informatie) wordt daarna tot 60 dagen bewaard, zodat andere BOINC-projecten waar je ook deel van uitmaakt op de hoogte kunnen worden gesteld van de verwijdering, waarna het ook automatisch wordt verwijderd. Back-ups die vóór een verwijdering zijn gemaakt, kunnen nog steeds je gegevens bevatten totdat ze zelf worden vervangen.";
$language_lookup_array["pl"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Dane konta i komputera są przechowywane tak długo, jak długo Twoje konto jest aktywne. Jeśli usuniesz swoje konto, zostaje ono w pełni i nieodwracalnie usunięte -- a nie tylko dezaktywowane -- wraz z Twoimi komputerami, postami na forum, wiadomościami prywatnymi, historią kredytu i profilem. Mały pseudonimowy rekord (tylko wewnętrzny identyfikator i znacznik czasu, bez danych osobowych) jest przechowywany do 60 dni później, aby inne projekty BOINC, których jesteś częścią, mogły zostać powiadomione o usunięciu, po czym również on zostaje automatycznie usunięty. Kopie zapasowe wykonane przed usunięciem mogą nadal zawierać Twoje dane, dopóki same nie zostaną zastąpione nowszymi.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_BR"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Os dados de conta e computador são mantidos enquanto sua conta estiver ativa. Se você excluir sua conta, ela é apagada total e irreversivelmente -- não apenas desativada -- junto com seus computadores, postagens no fórum, mensagens privadas, histórico de créditos e perfil. Um pequeno registro pseudônimo (apenas um ID interno e carimbo de data/hora, sem informações pessoais) é mantido por até 60 dias depois, para que outros projetos BOINC dos quais você também participa possam ser notificados da exclusão, e então ele também é removido automaticamente. Backups feitos antes de uma exclusão ainda podem conter seus dados até que eles próprios sejam substituídos.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_PT"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Os dados de conta e computador são mantidos enquanto a sua conta estiver ativa. Se eliminar a sua conta, esta é apagada total e irreversivelmente -- não apenas desativada -- juntamente com os seus computadores, publicações no fórum, mensagens privadas, histórico de crédito e perfil. Um pequeno registo pseudónimo (apenas um ID interno e carimbo de data/hora, sem informação pessoal) é mantido até 60 dias depois, para que outros projetos BOINC de que também faz parte possam ser notificados da eliminação, sendo depois também removido automaticamente. As cópias de segurança feitas antes de uma eliminação podem ainda conter os seus dados até serem elas próprias substituídas.";
$language_lookup_array["ru"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Данные учётной записи и компьютера хранятся, пока ваша учётная запись активна. Если вы удалите свою учётную запись, она будет полностью и безвозвратно удалена -- а не просто деактивирована -- вместе с вашими компьютерами, сообщениями форума, личными сообщениями, историей кредита и профилем. Небольшая псевдонимная запись (только внутренний ID и метка времени, без личной информации) хранится до 60 дней после этого, чтобы другие проекты BOINC, участником которых вы также являетесь, могли быть уведомлены об удалении, после чего она тоже удаляется автоматически. Резервные копии, сделанные до удаления, могут по-прежнему содержать ваши данные, пока сами не будут заменены новыми.";
$language_lookup_array["sk"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Údaje o účte a počítači sa uchovávajú, kým je váš účet aktívny. Ak svoj účet zmažete, je úplne a nezvratne vymazaný -- nielen deaktivovaný -- spolu s vašimi počítačmi, príspevkami na fóre, súkromnými správami, históriou kreditov a profilom. Malý pseudonymný záznam (iba interné ID a časová pečiatka, žiadne osobné údaje) sa uchováva až 60 dní potom, aby mohli byť o vymazaní informované ďalšie projekty BOINC, ktorých ste tiež súčasťou, potom je automaticky odstránený aj on. Zálohy vytvorené pred vymazaním môžu stále obsahovať vaše údaje, kým samy nebudú nahradené novšími.";
$language_lookup_array["sv"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Konto- och datordata behålls så länge ditt konto är aktivt. Om du tar bort ditt konto raderas det helt och oåterkalleligt -- inte bara inaktiveras -- tillsammans med dina datorer, foruminlägg, privata meddelanden, poänghistorik och profil. En liten pseudonym post (endast ett internt ID och en tidsstämpel, ingen personlig information) behålls i upp till 60 dagar därefter så att andra BOINC-projekt du också är en del av kan meddelas om raderingen, sedan tas även den bort automatiskt. Säkerhetskopior som tagits före en radering kan fortfarande innehålla dina uppgifter tills de själva roteras ut.";
$language_lookup_array["tr"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Hesap ve bilgisayar verileri, hesabınız etkin olduğu sürece saklanır. Hesabınızı silerseniz, yalnızca devre dışı bırakılmaz -- bilgisayarlarınız, forum gönderileriniz, özel mesajlarınız, kredi geçmişiniz ve profilinizle birlikte tamamen ve geri döndürülemez şekilde silinir. Küçük bir takma ad kaydı (yalnızca dahili bir kimlik ve zaman damgası, kişisel bilgi içermez) daha sonra en fazla 60 gün süreyle saklanır, böylece parçası olduğunuz diğer BOINC projeleri silme işlemi hakkında bilgilendirilebilir, ardından bu kayıt da otomatik olarak kaldırılır. Bir silme işleminden önce alınan yedeklemeler, kendileri değiştirilene kadar hâlâ verilerinizi içerebilir.";
$language_lookup_array["uk"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Дані облікового запису та комп'ютера зберігаються, поки ваш обліковий запис активний. Якщо ви видалите свій обліковий запис, він буде повністю і безповоротно видалений -- а не просто деактивований -- разом із вашими комп'ютерами, повідомленнями форуму, приватними повідомленнями, історією кредиту та профілем. Невеликий псевдонімний запис (лише внутрішній ID і часова мітка, без особистої інформації) зберігається до 60 днів після цього, щоб інші проєкти BOINC, учасником яких ви також є, могли бути повідомлені про видалення, після чого він також видаляється автоматично. Резервні копії, зроблені до видалення, можуть все ще містити ваші дані, поки самі не будуть замінені новішими.";
$language_lookup_array["vi"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "Dữ liệu tài khoản và máy tính được lưu giữ trong suốt thời gian tài khoản của bạn còn hoạt động. Nếu bạn xóa tài khoản, tài khoản sẽ bị xóa hoàn toàn và không thể khôi phục -- không chỉ vô hiệu hóa -- cùng với máy tính, bài đăng diễn đàn, tin nhắn riêng, lịch sử credit và hồ sơ của bạn. Một bản ghi ẩn danh nhỏ (chỉ gồm ID nội bộ và dấu thời gian, không có thông tin cá nhân) được lưu giữ tối đa 60 ngày sau đó để các dự án BOINC khác mà bạn cũng tham gia có thể được thông báo về việc xóa, sau đó bản ghi này cũng tự động bị xóa. Các bản sao lưu được thực hiện trước khi xóa vẫn có thể chứa dữ liệu của bạn cho đến khi chính chúng bị thay thế.";
$language_lookup_array["zh_CN"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "账户和计算机数据会在您的账户处于活跃状态期间保留。如果您删除账户,该账户会被彻底且不可逆地清除——而不仅仅是停用——同时清除您的计算机、论坛帖子、私信、积分历史和个人资料。之后会保留一条小型化名记录(仅包含内部ID和时间戳,不含个人信息)最长60天,以便通知您也参与的其他BOINC项目该账户已被删除,之后该记录也会自动移除。删除之前生成的备份在其自身被轮换替换之前,可能仍然包含您的数据。";
$language_lookup_array["zh_TW"]["Account and computer data is kept for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, it is fully and irreversibly erased -- not just deactivated -- along with your computers, forum posts, private messages, credit history, and profile. A small pseudonymous record (just an internal ID and timestamp, no personal information) is kept for up to 60 days afterward so other BOINC projects you're also part of can be notified of the deletion, then it too is removed automatically. Backups taken before a deletion may still contain your data until they themselves are rotated out."] = "帳戶和電腦資料會在您的帳戶處於活躍狀態期間保留。如果您刪除帳戶,該帳戶會被徹底且不可逆地清除——而不僅僅是停用——同時清除您的電腦、論壇貼文、私訊、積分歷史和個人資料。之後會保留一筆小型化名記錄(僅包含內部ID和時間戳記,不含個人資訊)最長60天,以便通知您也參與的其他BOINC專案該帳戶已被刪除,之後該記錄也會自動移除。刪除之前產生的備份在其自身被輪替取代之前,可能仍然包含您的資料。";
