$language_lookup_array["it_IT"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Se ti trovi nell'Unione Europea o in un'altra giurisdizione con tutele simili, hai il diritto di accedere, correggere, esportare o cancellare i tuoi dati, di opporti o limitare parte del trattamento descritto sopra, e di presentare un reclamo alla tua autorità locale di protezione dei dati. Puoi eliminare tu stesso il tuo account e tutti i dati associati in qualsiasi momento dalle impostazioni del tuo account; per qualsiasi altra cosa, contatta %1.";
$language_lookup_array["az"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Avropa İttifaqında və ya oxşar qorunma tədbirləri olan başqa bir yurisdiksiyada yaşayırsınızsa, məlumatlarınıza çıxış hüququnuz, onları düzəltmə, ixrac etmə və ya silmə hüququnuz var, yuxarıda təsvir olunan bəzi emal əməliyyatlarına etiraz etmə və ya onu məhdudlaşdırma hüququnuz var, həmçinin yerli məlumatların qorunması orqanına şikayət etmə hüququnuz var. Hesabınızı və ona aid bütün məlumatları istənilən vaxt hesab ayarlarınızdan özünüz silə bilərsiniz; digər hər şey üçün %1 ilə əlaqə saxlayın.";
$language_lookup_array["ca"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Si et trobes a la Unió Europea o en una altra jurisdicció amb proteccions similars, tens dret a accedir, corregir, exportar o esborrar les teves dades, a oposar-te o restringir part del tractament descrit anteriorment, i a presentar una queixa a la teva autoritat local de protecció de dades. Pots eliminar tu mateix el teu compte i totes les dades associades en qualsevol moment des de la configuració del teu compte; per a qualsevol altra cosa, contacta amb %1.";
$language_lookup_array["cs"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Pokud se nacházíte v Evropské unii nebo v jiné jurisdikci s podobnou ochranou, máte právo na přístup ke svým údajům, jejich opravu, export nebo výmaz, na námitku proti některému ze zpracování popsaného výše nebo na jeho omezení a na podání stížnosti u místního úřadu pro ochranu osobních údajů. Svůj účet a všechny přidružené údaje můžete sami kdykoli smazat v nastavení svého účtu; ohledně čehokoli jiného kontaktujte %1.";
$language_lookup_array["de"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Wenn Sie sich in der Europäischen Union oder einer anderen Rechtsordnung mit ähnlichem Schutz befinden, haben Sie das Recht, auf Ihre Daten zuzugreifen, sie zu berichtigen, zu exportieren oder zu löschen, einigen der oben beschriebenen Verarbeitungen zu widersprechen oder sie einzuschränken, und sich bei Ihrer örtlichen Datenschutzbehörde zu beschweren. Sie können Ihr Konto und alle zugehörigen Daten jederzeit selbst über Ihre Kontoeinstellungen löschen; für alles andere wenden Sie sich an %1.";
$language_lookup_array["es"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Si te encuentras en la Unión Europea o en otra jurisdicción con protecciones similares, tienes derecho a acceder, corregir, exportar o borrar tus datos, a oponerte o restringir parte del tratamiento descrito anteriormente, y a presentar una reclamación ante tu autoridad local de protección de datos. Puedes eliminar tú mismo tu cuenta y todos los datos asociados en cualquier momento desde la configuración de tu cuenta; para cualquier otra cosa, contacta con %1.";
$language_lookup_array["eu"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Europar Batasunean edo antzeko babesak dituen beste jurisdikzio batean bazaude, zure datuak atzitzeko, zuzentzeko, esportatzeko edo ezabatzeko eskubidea duzu, goian azaldutako prozesamenduaren zati bati aurka egiteko edo mugatzeko, eta zure tokiko datu-babeserako agintaritzari kexa bat aurkezteko. Zure kontua eta lotutako datu guztiak zeuk ezaba ditzakezu edonoiz zure kontuaren ezarpenetatik; beste edozer gauzetarako, jarri harremanetan %1(r)ekin.";
$language_lookup_array["fi"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Jos olet Euroopan unionissa tai muulla vastaavan suojan tarjoavalla lainkäyttöalueella, sinulla on oikeus käyttää, korjata, viedä tai poistaa tietosi, vastustaa tai rajoittaa joitakin edellä kuvatuista käsittelytoimista sekä tehdä valitus paikalliselle tietosuojaviranomaisellesi. Voit itse poistaa tilisi ja kaikki siihen liittyvät tiedot milloin tahansa tiliasetuksistasi; kaikessa muussa ota yhteyttä %1.";
$language_lookup_array["fr"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Si vous êtes dans l'Union européenne ou une autre juridiction offrant des protections similaires, vous avez le droit d'accéder à vos données, de les corriger, de les exporter ou de les effacer, de vous opposer à certains traitements décrits ci-dessus ou de les restreindre, et de déposer une plainte auprès de votre autorité locale de protection des données. Vous pouvez supprimer vous-même votre compte et toutes les données associées à tout moment depuis les paramètres de votre compte ; pour tout le reste, contactez %1.";
$language_lookup_array["he"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "אם אתם באיחוד האירופי או בתחום שיפוט אחר עם הגנות דומות, יש לכם זכות לגשת לנתונים שלכם, לתקן, לייצא או למחוק אותם, להתנגד לחלק מהעיבוד המתואר לעיל או להגביל אותו, ולהגיש תלונה לרשות הגנת המידע המקומית שלכם. תוכלו למחוק בעצמכם את החשבון שלכם וכל הנתונים הקשורים אליו בכל עת מהגדרות החשבון שלכם; לכל דבר אחר, צרו קשר עם %1.";
$language_lookup_array["hu"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Ha az Európai Unióban vagy más, hasonló védelmet nyújtó joghatóság alá tartozó területen tartózkodik, joga van hozzáférni adataihoz, azokat kijavítani, exportálni vagy törölni, kifogást emelni a fent leírt egyes feldolgozási műveletek ellen vagy azokat korlátozni, valamint panaszt tenni a helyi adatvédelmi hatóságnál. Fiókját és minden kapcsolódó adatot bármikor maga is törölhet a fiókbeállításokból; minden más ügyben forduljon %1-hez.";
$language_lookup_array["ja"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "欧州連合または同様の保護がある他の法域にいる場合、あなたのデータへのアクセス、訂正、エクスポート、消去を求める権利、上記の処理の一部に異議を唱えたり制限を求めたりする権利、および現地のデータ保護当局に苦情を申し立てる権利があります。アカウントおよび関連するすべてのデータは、いつでもアカウント設定からご自身で削除できます。それ以外については%1までご連絡ください。";
$language_lookup_array["ko"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "귀하가 유럽연합 또는 유사한 보호를 제공하는 다른 관할권에 있는 경우, 데이터에 접근, 수정, 내보내기 또는 삭제할 권리, 위에 설명된 일부 처리에 반대하거나 제한할 권리, 그리고 현지 데이터 보호 기관에 불만을 제기할 권리가 있습니다. 계정 설정에서 언제든지 직접 계정과 관련된 모든 데이터를 삭제할 수 있습니다. 그 외의 사항은 %1로 문의하세요.";
$language_lookup_array["nb"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Hvis du er i EU eller en annen jurisdiksjon med lignende beskyttelse, har du rett til å få tilgang til, rette, eksportere eller slette dataene dine, til å protestere mot eller begrense noe av behandlingen beskrevet ovenfor, og til å klage til din lokale datatilsynsmyndighet. Du kan selv slette kontoen din og alle tilknyttede data når som helst fra kontoinnstillingene dine; for alt annet, kontakt %1.";
$language_lookup_array["nl"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Als je je in de Europese Unie of een ander rechtsgebied met vergelijkbare bescherming bevindt, heb je het recht om je gegevens in te zien, te corrigeren, te exporteren of te wissen, om bezwaar te maken tegen of een deel van de hierboven beschreven verwerking te beperken, en om een klacht in te dienen bij je lokale gegevensbeschermingsautoriteit. Je kunt je account en alle bijbehorende gegevens op elk moment zelf verwijderen via je accountinstellingen; voor al het overige neem je contact op met %1.";
$language_lookup_array["pl"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Jeśli znajdujesz się w Unii Europejskiej lub innej jurysdykcji o podobnej ochronie, masz prawo do dostępu, poprawiania, eksportowania lub usuwania swoich danych, do sprzeciwienia się lub ograniczenia części opisanego powyżej przetwarzania oraz do złożenia skargi do lokalnego organu ochrony danych. Możesz sam usunąć swoje konto i wszystkie powiązane dane w dowolnym momencie w ustawieniach konta; w każdej innej sprawie skontaktuj się z %1.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_BR"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Se você estiver na União Europeia ou em outra jurisdição com proteções semelhantes, você tem o direito de acessar, corrigir, exportar ou apagar seus dados, de se opor ou restringir parte do processamento descrito acima, e de apresentar uma reclamação à sua autoridade local de proteção de dados. Você pode excluir sua conta e todos os dados associados sozinho, a qualquer momento, nas configurações da sua conta; para qualquer outra coisa, entre em contato com %1.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_PT"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Se estiver na União Europeia ou noutra jurisdição com proteções semelhantes, tem o direito de aceder, corrigir, exportar ou apagar os seus dados, de se opor ou restringir parte do processamento descrito acima, e de apresentar uma reclamação à sua autoridade local de proteção de dados. Pode eliminar a sua conta e todos os dados associados sozinho, a qualquer momento, nas definições da sua conta; para qualquer outra coisa, contacte %1.";
$language_lookup_array["ru"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Если вы находитесь в Европейском союзе или другой юрисдикции с аналогичной защитой, вы имеете право на доступ, исправление, экспорт или удаление своих данных, на возражение против некоторых видов обработки, описанных выше, или их ограничение, а также на подачу жалобы в местный орган по защите данных. Вы можете сами удалить свою учётную запись и все связанные с ней данные в любой момент в настройках учётной записи; по любым другим вопросам обращайтесь к %1.";
$language_lookup_array["sk"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Ak sa nachádzate v Európskej únii alebo inej jurisdikcii s podobnou ochranou, máte právo na prístup k svojim údajom, ich opravu, export alebo vymazanie, na námietku proti niektorému zo spracovaní opísaných vyššie alebo na jeho obmedzenie a na podanie sťažnosti miestnemu úradu na ochranu osobných údajov. Svoj účet a všetky súvisiace údaje môžete sami kedykoľvek vymazať v nastaveniach svojho účtu; v prípade čohokoľvek iného kontaktujte %1.";
$language_lookup_array["sv"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Om du befinner dig i Europeiska unionen eller en annan jurisdiktion med liknande skydd har du rätt att få tillgång till, rätta, exportera eller radera dina uppgifter, att invända mot eller begränsa delar av den behandling som beskrivs ovan, och att lämna in ett klagomål till din lokala dataskyddsmyndighet. Du kan själv radera ditt konto och alla tillhörande uppgifter när som helst från dina kontoinställningar; för allt annat, kontakta %1.";
$language_lookup_array["tr"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Avrupa Birliği'nde veya benzer korumalara sahip başka bir yargı alanındaysanız, verilerinize erişme, düzeltme, dışa aktarma veya silme, yukarıda açıklanan işlemlerin bazılarına itiraz etme veya kısıtlama, ve yerel veri koruma otoritenize şikayette bulunma hakkına sahipsiniz. Hesabınızı ve ilişkili tüm verileri istediğiniz zaman hesap ayarlarınızdan kendiniz silebilirsiniz; başka her şey için %1 ile iletişime geçin.";
$language_lookup_array["uk"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Якщо ви перебуваєте в Європейському Союзі або іншій юрисдикції з подібним захистом, ви маєте право на доступ, виправлення, експорт або видалення своїх даних, на заперечення проти деяких видів обробки, описаних вище, або їх обмеження, а також на подання скарги до місцевого органу захисту даних. Ви можете самостійно видалити свій обліковий запис і всі пов'язані дані в будь-який момент у налаштуваннях облікового запису; з усіх інших питань звертайтеся до %1.";
$language_lookup_array["vi"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "Nếu bạn ở Liên minh Châu Âu hoặc khu vực pháp lý khác có bảo vệ tương tự, bạn có quyền truy cập, sửa, xuất hoặc xóa dữ liệu của mình, phản đối hoặc hạn chế một số hoạt động xử lý được mô tả ở trên, và khiếu nại với cơ quan bảo vệ dữ liệu tại địa phương của bạn. Bạn có thể tự xóa tài khoản và toàn bộ dữ liệu liên quan bất kỳ lúc nào từ cài đặt tài khoản; đối với những vấn đề khác, hãy liên hệ %1.";
$language_lookup_array["zh_CN"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "如果您位于欧盟或其他具有类似保护措施的司法管辖区,您有权访问、更正、导出或删除您的数据,反对或限制上述某些处理活动,并向当地数据保护机构投诉。您可以随时通过账户设置自行删除您的账户及所有相关数据;如有其他事宜,请联系%1。";
$language_lookup_array["zh_TW"]["If you're in the European Union or another jurisdiction with similar protections, you have the right to access, correct, export, or erase your data, to object to or restrict some of the processing described above, and to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority. You can delete your account and all associated data yourself at any time from your account settings; for anything else, contact %1."] = "如果您位於歐盟或其他具有類似保護措施的司法管轄區,您有權存取、更正、匯出或刪除您的資料,反對或限制上述某些處理活動,並向當地資料保護機構投訴。您可以隨時透過帳戶設定自行刪除您的帳戶及所有相關資料;如有其他事宜,請聯絡%1。";

