$language_lookup_array["it_IT"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Lo spazio di ricerca è diviso in blocchi da un miliardo di smazzate ciascuno. Due volontari calcolano lo stesso blocco in modo indipendente, e il blocco viene confermato solo quando i loro risultati corrispondono esattamente.";
$language_lookup_array["az"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Axtarış sahəsi hər biri milyard paylanmadan ibarət bloklara bölünür. İki könüllü eyni bloku müstəqil hesablayır və blok yalnız nəticələr tam uyğun gəldikdə təsdiqlənir.";
$language_lookup_array["ca"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "L'espai de cerca es divideix en blocs d'un mil milions de repartiments cadascun. Dos voluntaris calculen el mateix bloc de forma independent, i el bloc només es confirma quan els seus resultats coincideixen exactament.";
$language_lookup_array["cs"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Vyhledávací prostor je rozdělen do bloků po miliardě rozdání. Dva dobrovolníci nezávisle spočítají stejný blok a blok je potvrzen až tehdy, když se jejich výsledky přesně shodují.";
$language_lookup_array["de"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Der Suchraum ist in Blöcke von jeweils einer Milliarde Verteilungen unterteilt. Zwei Freiwillige berechnen unabhängig voneinander denselben Block, und der Block wird erst bestätigt, wenn ihre Ergebnisse exakt übereinstimmen.";
$language_lookup_array["es"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "El espacio de búsqueda se divide en bloques de mil millones de repartos cada uno. Dos voluntarios calculan el mismo bloque de forma independiente, y el bloque solo se confirma cuando sus resultados coinciden exactamente.";
$language_lookup_array["eu"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Bilaketa-espazioa bloketan banatzen da, bakoitzak mila milioi banaketa dituela. Bi boluntariok bloke bera modu independentean kalkulatzen dute, eta blokea haien emaitzak zehazki bat datozenean baino ez da berresten.";
$language_lookup_array["fi"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Hakuavaruus on jaettu lohkoihin, joissa kussakin on miljardi jakoa. Kaksi vapaaehtoista laskee saman lohkon toisistaan riippumatta, ja lohko vahvistetaan vasta, kun heidän tuloksensa täsmäävät tarkalleen.";
$language_lookup_array["fr"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "L'espace de recherche est divisé en blocs d'un milliard de donnes chacun. Deux volontaires calculent le même bloc indépendamment, et le bloc n'est confirmé que lorsque leurs résultats correspondent exactement.";
$language_lookup_array["he"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "מרחב החיפוש מחולק לבלוקים של מיליארד חלוקות כל אחד. שני מתנדבים מחשבים את אותו הבלוק באופן עצמאי, והבלוק מאושר רק כאשר התוצאות שלהם תואמות במדויק.";
$language_lookup_array["hu"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "A keresési teret milliárd osztásból álló blokkokra osztjuk. Két önkéntes egymástól függetlenül számítja ki ugyanazt a blokkot, és a blokk csak akkor kerül megerősítésre, ha eredményeik pontosan megegyeznek.";
$language_lookup_array["ja"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "検索空間は、それぞれ10億回の配りからなるブロックに分割されています。2人のボランティアが同じブロックを独立して計算し、結果が完全に一致した場合にのみそのブロックが確定します。";
$language_lookup_array["ko"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "검색 공간은 각각 10억 개의 배분으로 이루어진 블록으로 나뉩니다. 두 명의 자원봉사자가 독립적으로 동일한 블록을 계산하며, 그 결과가 정확히 일치할 때만 블록이 확정됩니다.";
$language_lookup_array["nb"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Søkeområdet er delt inn i blokker med en milliard gjevinger hver. To frivillige beregner den samme blokken uavhengig av hverandre, og blokken bekreftes først når resultatene deres stemmer nøyaktig overens.";
$language_lookup_array["nl"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "De zoekruimte is verdeeld in blokken van elk een miljard verdelingen. Twee vrijwilligers berekenen onafhankelijk hetzelfde blok, en het blok wordt pas bevestigd zodra hun resultaten precies overeenkomen.";
$language_lookup_array["pl"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Przestrzeń przeszukiwań jest podzielona na bloki po miliard rozdań każdy. Dwóch wolontariuszy niezależnie oblicza ten sam blok, a blok zostaje potwierdzony dopiero, gdy ich wyniki dokładnie się zgadzają.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_BR"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "O espaço de busca é dividido em blocos de um bilhão de distribuições cada. Dois voluntários calculam o mesmo bloco de forma independente, e o bloco só é confirmado quando seus resultados coincidem exatamente.";
$language_lookup_array["pt_PT"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "O espaço de pesquisa é dividido em blocos de mil milhões de distribuições cada. Dois voluntários calculam o mesmo bloco de forma independente, e o bloco só é confirmado quando os seus resultados coincidem exatamente.";
$language_lookup_array["ru"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Пространство поиска разделено на блоки по миллиарду раздач каждый. Два волонтёра независимо вычисляют один и тот же блок, и блок подтверждается только тогда, когда их результаты полностью совпадают.";
$language_lookup_array["sk"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Vyhľadávací priestor je rozdelený na bloky po miliarde rozdaní. Dvaja dobrovoľníci nezávisle vypočítajú rovnaký blok a blok je potvrdený až vtedy, keď sa ich výsledky presne zhodujú.";
$language_lookup_array["sv"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Sökutrymmet är indelat i block med en miljard givar vardera. Två volontärer beräknar samma block oberoende av varandra, och blocket bekräftas först när deras resultat exakt matchar.";
$language_lookup_array["tr"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Arama alanı, her biri bir milyar dağıtımdan oluşan bloklara bölünmüştür. İki gönüllü aynı bloğu bağımsız olarak hesaplar ve blok yalnızca sonuçları tam olarak eşleştiğinde onaylanır.";
$language_lookup_array["uk"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Простір пошуку поділено на блоки по мільярду роздач кожен. Два волонтери незалежно обчислюють один і той самий блок, і блок підтверджується лише тоді, коли їхні результати повністю збігаються.";
$language_lookup_array["vi"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "Không gian tìm kiếm được chia thành các khối, mỗi khối gồm một tỷ ván bài. Hai tình nguyện viên tính toán cùng một khối một cách độc lập, và khối chỉ được xác nhận khi kết quả của họ khớp chính xác.";
$language_lookup_array["zh_CN"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "搜索空间被划分为多个区块,每个区块包含十亿次发牌。两名志愿者独立计算同一个区块,只有当他们的结果完全一致时,该区块才会被确认。";
$language_lookup_array["zh_TW"]["The search space is divided into blocks of a billion deals each. Two volunteers compute the same block independently, and the block is only confirmed once their results match exactly."] = "搜尋空間被劃分為多個區塊,每個區塊包含十億次發牌。兩名志工獨立計算同一個區塊,只有當他們的結果完全一致時,該區塊才會被確認。";
